  This project must demonstrate:

IoC Container

Dependency Injection

@Component

@Autowired

@Configuration

@ComponentScan

Layered Architecture

  #########################Developement Assignment########################################
1.	Develop a Banking Management System using Spring Core with Annotation Configuration.

2.	Create a model class Account containing accountNumber, accountHolderName, accountType, and balance.

3.	Implement a DepositService to add money to the account balance.

4.	Implement a WithdrawService to deduct money from the account after checking sufficient balance.

5.	Implement an InterestService to calculate interest on the current balance.

6.	Create a BankingService that uses all services using @Autowired dependency injection.

7.	Display account details and the final balance after deposit, withdrawal, and interest calculation.

8.	Configure Spring using @Configuration and @ComponentScan in BankConfig class.

9.	Load the Spring container using AnnotationConfigApplicationContext in the main class.

10.	Test the application by creating an Account object and performing banking operations.

  
